- 组合层加载:`--dump-config` 出现 `# == @y1x1n/dsh-prompt-optimizer` 层;
- Host:启动日志 `[dsh-prompt-optimizer] loaded`,优化路由与测试路由的 400/405/409/413 各路径行为正确,SSE 流式输出实测正常;
- Client:bundle 被 client-modules 扫描收录并出现在页面 boot manifest(0.1.5 起以 `/plugins/??<ids>&rev=<hash>` 组合 URL 提供),插件行出现在模块清单中;
- 端到端:真实调用 `ctx.llm` 完成「分析 + 优化」,标记解析正确(`wellFormed: true`)。**v0.6.3 的 rc.5 复测已成功产出优化稿**(`provider: magpie`、`model: group/safely-deepseek`、`wellFormed: true`、`truncated: false`);v0.6.2 的 rc.3 复测因测试账户余额为 0,只验证到上游错误态与面板透传。
- 自动化测试(`npm test`,共 99 例):
  - `test/smoke.mjs`:35 项 Host 冒烟用例(真实 cordis Context + mock 服务,覆盖路由解析优先级、空字符串/畸形配置、400/405/409/413、非对象 JSON 体拒绝、SSE 事件流、SSE 阶段错误不逃出路由、并发上限 429、载体服务只挂载一次、max-tokens 截断、超时、快速模式与默认模式、推理钳档(按强度序数而非展示顺序)、旧版设置文档归一化、连接测试、会话标注兜底、回退链与回退原因透传、tool-calls 防御、输出上限自适应、上下文注入与硬开关、策略选择、记忆链注入与截断、来源围栏);
  - `test/prompt.test.mjs`:25 项元提示词解析用例(标记空白变体、降级路径、空 OPTIMIZED 段不回退、标记字样不进入结果、未闭合思考块不污染解析、流式实况解析、新旧两种输出顺序、流式缓冲压缩(单段/两段式)、token 估算 CJK 覆盖、上下文载荷与预算收敛、策略分叉、保真纪律与示例、记忆链载荷);
  - `test/controller.test.mjs`:29 项客户端纯逻辑用例(SSE 帧解析与损坏帧跳过、合帧节流、连接中断、跳过会话查询、撤回流转、retry 保留斜杠前缀、close 中止、cancel 取消保留已生成部分及其状态门槛、客户端超时看门狗、历史提取过滤与失败降级、斜杠前缀拆分与空命令拦截、记忆链传递与门槛、发送即关闭判定、耗时记录、上下文取样用户消息保底、新输出顺序的流式预览与压缩兜底);
  - `t

- Composition-layer load: `--dump-config` shows the `# == @y1x1n/dsh-prompt-optimizer` layer;
- Host: startup log `[dsh-prompt-optimizer] loaded`; both routes behave correctly across their 400/405/409/413 paths; SSE streaming verified live;
- Client: the bundle is picked up by client-modules and listed in the page boot manifest (from 0.1.5 served through the combined `/plugins/??<ids>&rev=<hash>` URL), with the plugin row present in the module list;
- End to end: a real `ctx.llm` call completes "analysis + rewrite" with correct marker parsing (`wellFormed: true`). **The v0.6.3 rc.5 re-run produced a successful rewrite** (`provider: magpie`, `model: group/safely-deepseek`, `wellFormed: true`, `truncated: false`); the v0.6.2 rc.3 re-run verified only the upstream error state and panel pass-through because the test account had zero balance.
- Automated tests (`npm test`, 99 cases):
  - `test/smoke.mjs`: 35 Host smoke cases (real cordis Context + mocked services: route-resolution priority, empty/malformed config, 400/405/409/413, non-object JSON body rejection, SSE event flow, post-header errors not escaping the route, concurrency cap 429, carrier service mounted exactly once, max-toke

1. Published packages are `npm pack`ed and extracted straight into `node_modules` (bypassing npm's dependency-tree resolution);
2. For unpublished packages (e.g. `dsh-type-meta`), it scans every `.d.ts` reference and generates minimal stub packages (only module resolvability matters under `skipLibCheck`).

These packages only participate in type checking; at runtime everything is provided by the Harness page/process (`react` and `@deepseek-ai/*` are external).
